Looking at this assembly, I can identify:
- AccessControlEnumerable-based role system with a hasMinRole extension
- An owner (slot 2), aggregator address (slot 3), and various fee/split settings (slots 4-8)
- Chainlink price feed integration via `latestRoundData()`
- Fee calculations in ETH based on USD price

